  {
    "id": "1.1_M01",
    "label": "距离的定义域与三条条件",
    "latex": "\\begin{gathered}X\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad \\rho:X\\times X\\longrightarrow\\mathbb R\\\\\\rho(x,y)\\ge0,\\quad \\rho(x,y)=0\\iff x=y\\\\\\rho(x,y)=\\rho(y,x)\\\\\\rho(x,z)\\le\\rho(x,y)+\\rho(y,z)\\quad(\\forall x,y,z\\in X)\\end{gathered}",
    "frame": "1.1_B0179",
    "explanation": "量词统一集中在式末；第一、二条对所有x,y∈X成立。",
