  {
    "id": "1.1_M04",
    "label": "实向量内积、Cauchy–Schwarz与交叉项",
    "latex": "\\begin{gathered}\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\sum_{i=1}^{d}u_i v_i\\\\|\\langle u,v\\rangle|\\le\\|u\\|_2\\,\\|v\\|_2\\end{gathered}",
    "frame": "1.1_B0224",
    "explanation": "仅针对实向量内积；不当作复内积定义。",
    "status": "板书结构与课堂内容核对；记号规范化整理",
    "source_id": "M04",
    "part_id": "1.1",
    "section": "欧氏距离的三角不等式：用Cauchy–Schwarz估计",
    "section_start": 1986,
