    "label": "函数作为点与最大值距离",
    "latex": "\\begin{gathered}C[a,b]=\\{f:[a,b]\\to\\mathbb R\\mid f\\text{连续}\\}\\\\\\rho(f,g)=\\max_{t\\in[a,b]}|f(t)-g(t)|\\end{gathered}",
